{
  "title": "Reel Studio: the full app",
  "lang": "en",
  "engine": "elevenlabs",
  "voice": "J9NvviOEdVm6E7Hwdpdj",
  "presenter": {
    "photo": "examples/assets/presenter/presenter.png",
    "crop": [
      450,
      200,
      420
    ],
    "title": "Your title · Your role",
    "subtitle": "How Reel Studio works"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "This is Reel Studio. A video editor I built with AI, and this whole video was made by it.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "title",
          "params": {
            "kicker": "REEL STUDIO",
            "text": "An AI video editor I built"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You give it an idea. It gives you a finished video. Here is what happens inside.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "pipeline",
          "params": {
            "title": "What happens inside",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "label": "Script",
                "sub": "Claude writes it"
              },
              {
                "label": "Voice",
                "sub": "ElevenLabs or you"
              },
              {
                "label": "Captions",
                "sub": "each word timed"
              },
              {
                "label": "Graphics",
                "sub": "HyperFrames"
              },
              {
                "label": "Export",
                "sub": "4K · 60 fps"
              },
              {
                "label": "Quality check",
                "sub": "must pass"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Story one. You ask: what happened at American airports yesterday?",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "chat",
          "params": {
            "prompt": "What happened at US airports yesterday?",
            "reply": "An FAA ground stop. Checking the sources…"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Claude reads the news, checks every fact, and writes a one-minute script.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "list",
          "params": {
            "title": "Research",
            "items": [
              "Read the news",
              "Check every fact",
              "Write the script"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It finds real photos it is allowed to use, and puts the credit on screen.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "photo",
          "params": {
            "src": "examples/assets/airports/taxiway.jpg",
            "kicker": "STORY 1 · NEWS",
            "headline": "Real photos, real credits",
            "tag": "Boston Logan · file photo",
            "credit": "Photo: 4300streetcar · CC BY 4.0 · Wikimedia Commons"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "More than 4,700 cancelled flights become a number you can feel.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "stat",
          "params": {
            "value": "4700",
            "suffix": "+",
            "label": "flights cancelled"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then a voice reads the script, and AI listens to every single line.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "terminal",
          "params": {
            "title": "reel narrate",
            "command": "reel narrate airports.json",
            "lines": [
              "→ voice 1/13 · ElevenLabs",
              "✓ heard back: every word clean",
              "→ voice 2/13",
              "✗ \"look\" said twice",
              "→ new take, respelled",
              "✓ heard back: every word clean",
              "→ graphics 13/13 rendered",
              "✓ 4K · 60 fps · HEVC"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Here is the code. The voice speaks, Whisper listens back, and if one word is wrong, it tries again.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "code",
          "params": {
            "title": "voice/pronounce.py",
            "lines": [
              "for attempt in range(4):",
              "    audio = voice.speak(line)",
              "    heard = whisper.listen(audio)",
              "    if heard == script:",
              "        break  # clean take",
              "    line = respell(line)"
            ],
            "steps": [
              {
                "line": 1,
                "note": "Try 1"
              },
              {
                "line": 2,
                "note": "Speak the line"
              },
              {
                "line": 3,
                "note": "Heard: \"eye\"",
                "kind": "bad"
              },
              {
                "line": 4,
                "note": "\"AI\" ≠ \"eye\"",
                "kind": "bad"
              },
              {
                "line": 6,
                "note": "Respell: AI → A.I."
              },
              {
                "line": 1,
                "note": "Try 2"
              },
              {
                "line": 3,
                "note": "Heard: \"AI\"",
                "kind": "ok"
              },
              {
                "line": 5,
                "note": "Clean take ✓",
                "kind": "ok"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Story two. Teach something. Why did Outlook go down in more than seventy countries?",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "photo",
          "params": {
            "src": "examples/assets/outlook/racks.jpg",
            "kicker": "STORY 2 · LESSON",
            "headline": "Why did Outlook go down?",
            "tag": "Servers · file photo",
            "credit": "Photo: NOIRLab/NSF/AURA/T. Slovinský · CC BY 4.0 · Wikimedia Commons"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It draws the servers, and you watch them fall like dominoes.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "cascade",
          "params": {
            "stage": "domino",
            "failed": 2,
            "title": "Like dominoes",
            "caption": "One fails, the rest overload"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Story three. Your own video. It finds every take, keeps your last clean one, and cuts the silence.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "list",
          "params": {
            "title": "Story 3 · Your footage",
            "items": [
              "Find every take",
              "Keep the last clean one",
              "Cut the silence"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It finds your face, so no graphic ever covers it.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "facebox",
          "params": {
            "src": "examples/assets/presenter/presenter.png",
            "img_w": 1080,
            "img_h": 1350,
            "face": [
              569,
              255,
              752,
              488
            ],
            "score": 0.95
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Or read it yourself. A teleprompter guides you, and the app cleans your voice.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "list",
          "params": {
            "title": "Record studio",
            "items": [
              "Teleprompter, line by line",
              "Pick your microphone",
              "Noise and silence removed"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Every video gets English captions, timed to each word, in 4K at 60 frames per second.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "stat",
          "params": {
            "value": "4",
            "suffix": "K",
            "label": "60 fps · captions on every word"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before anything is posted, it checks the final file. Picture, sound, and every word.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "terminal",
          "params": {
            "title": "reel qa",
            "command": "reel qa how-reel-studio-works",
            "lines": [
              "PASS  picture   2160x3840 · 60 fps · HEVC",
              "PASS  captions  56 English cues",
              "PASS  loudness  -14.0 LUFS",
              "PASS  no black or frozen frames",
              "PASS  every word heard: 169/169",
              "✓ QA PASSED"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "News, stories, lessons. One app. Want the code? Comment REPO, and I will send you the GitHub link.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "title",
          "params": {
            "kicker": "WANT THE CODE?",
            "text": "Comment REPO"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}